<tr><td>Stacked (pixel + logic wafer)</td><td><b>Phones</b>: Sony Exmor RS announced 2012, Xperia Z (2013)</td><td>1-inch RX100 IV (2015) → full frame α9 (2017) → automotive IMX490 (2018) → industrial Pregius S (2020)</td></tr>
